  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wabutha abantu ababelaye, wababekela izinduna zezinkulungwane lezinduna zamakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahlukanisa amabutho aba yizigaba ezintathu, esinye isigaba saphathwa nguJowabi, lesinye saphathwa ngumfowabo kaJowabi, uAbishayi indodana kaZeruya, esesithathu saphathwa nguIthayi waseGiti. Inkosi yawazisa amabutho ukuba layo uqobo izaphuma impi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa abantu bathi: Kawuyikuphuma. Ngoba uba sibaleka, kabayikuba landaba lathi; loba kusifa ingxenye yethu, kabayikuba landaba. Kanti wena ulingana lenkulungwane ezilitshumi zethu; ngakho kuhle usisize uphakathi komuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yasisithi kibo: Ngizakwenza lokho elikubona kulungile. Inkosi yasisima eceleni kwesango, wonke amabutho aphuma ngamakhulu langezinkulungwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yabalaya oJowabi loAbishayi loIthayi, yathi: Aliboliphatha kuhle ijaha uAbisalomu ngenxa yami. Bonke abantu bezwa lapho inkosi ilaya zonke izinduna ngoAbisalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impi yaphumela egangeni ukuyakulwa loIsrayeli, kwalwelwa eguswini elakoEfrayimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli behlulwa lapho ngabantu bakaDavida, kwaba khona ukubulalana okukhulu ngalolosuku, kwafa abantu abazinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impi yahlakazekela elizweni lonke, igusu laqeda abantu abanengi ngalolosuku ukwedlula umkhonto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbisalomu wahlangana lenceku zikaDavida. Wayegade imbongolo; kwathi isedlula ngaphansi kwengatsha zesihlahla esikhulu, ikhanda lakhe labanjwa zingatsha; imbongolo yadlula, yena wasala elenga emoyeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu othile wambona, watshela uJowabi wathi: Ngibone uAbisalomu elenga esihlahleni esikhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJowabi wathi kulowomuntu omtshelayo: Umbonile na? Kungani ungamjuqanga, wawela phansi na? Bengizakukunika inhlamvu ezilitshumi zesiliva kanye lebhanti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa lowomuntu wathi kuJowabi: Loba bengizanikwa inhlamvu eziyinkulungwane zesiliva, bengingayikusiphakamisela isandla sami endodaneni yenkosi, ngoba inkosi yakulaya wena loAbishayi loIthayi sisizwa yathi: Lilondolozeni ijaha uAbisalomu ngenxa yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba bengenze inkohliso ngokuphila kwakhe, inkosi ibizakukwazi lokho ngoba yona kayicatshelwa lutho, lawe uqobo ubungayikwenza lutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJowabi wasesithi: Kangiyikuchitha isikhathi ngokunjalo lawe. Wasethatha imikhonto emithathu, wamhlaba uAbisalomu enhliziyweni esezwa esabanjiwe yisihlahla esikhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Insizwa ezilitshumi ezaziphatha izikhali zikaJowabi, zamzingelezela uAbisalomu, zamtshaya zambulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJowabi wasetshaya uphondo, abantu babuya ekuxotshaneni loIsrayeli, ngoba uJowabi esebatshele ukuba bayekele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basithatha isidumbu sikaAbisalomu, basiphosela emgodini omkhulu eguswini, babuthelela inqwaba yamatshe phezulu; bonke abakoIsrayeli babalekela emakhaya abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAbisalomu esekhona wayemise insika esigodini senkosi, ngoba wathi: Angilandodana yokukhumbula ibizo lami. Leyonsika wayitha ibizo lakhe, kuthiwa yisikhumbuzo sikaAbisalomu kuze kube lamuhla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAhimazi indodana kaZadoki wasesithi: Ake ngigijime, ngiyibikele inkosi ukuthi iNkosi uNkulunkulu iyikhulule ezitheni zayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uJowabi wathi kuye: Kawuyikubika indaba lamuhla, kodwa uzazibika ngolunye usuku; lamhla kawuyikubika lutho, ngoba indodana yenkosi ifile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJowabi wasesithi kumEtiyopiya: Hamba uyebikela inkosi okubonileyo. UmEtiyopiya wakhothama phambi kukaJowabi, wasuka wagijima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAhimazi indodana kaZadoki wabuya wathi kuJowabi: Loba kunjani, ake ngigijime lami, ngimlandele umEtiyopiya. Kodwa uJowabi wathi: Uzagijimelani, mntanami, lokhu kawuyikuzuza umvuzo ngombiko wakho na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena wathi: Loba kunjani, ngizagijima. Wathi: Gijima. Wasegijima uAhimazi ngendlela edabula esigodini saseJordani, wamdlula emEtiyopiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wayehlezi phakathi kwamasango womabili; umlindi wakhwela waya ophahleni lwesango emdulini, wahle wabona umuntu egijima yedwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umlindi wamemeza wayitshela inkosi. Yathi inkosi: Uba eyedwa uletha indaba ezinhle. Umuntu lowo wayelokhu esondela njalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umlindi wabuya wabona omunye umuntu egijima; wabiza umlindisango wathi: Nanguya omunye umuntu ugijima yedwa. Inkosi yathi: Laye uletha indaba ezinhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umlindi wasesithi: Ngibona kungathi owokuqala ugijimisa uAhimazi indodana kaZadoki. Inkosi yathi: Ngumuntu olungileyo yena, uletha indaba ezinhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAhimazi wasekhuleka esithi enkosini: Bayethe! Wakhothama phambi kwenkosi, wakhangela phansi wathi: Kayibongwe iNkosi, uNkulunkulu wakho, enikele esandleni sakho abantu abavukela inkosi yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yathi: Injani insizwa uAbisalomu na? UAhimazi wathi: Ngibone ukuphithizela okukhulu lapho uJowabi inceku yenkosi engithuma, kodwa kangazanga ukuba bekwenze njani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yathi: Buyela eceleni, ume khona. Wasebuyela eceleni esima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
