          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yadabuka kakhulu inkosi, yakhwela yaya endlini engaphezu kwesango, yahamba ikhala isithi: Hawu, ndodana yami Abisalomu, ndodana yami, ndodana yami, Abisalomu! Kungathi ngabe kufe mina endaweni yakho! Hawu, Abisalomu, ndodana yami, ndodana yami!",
          "type": "text",
